%% Containment ladder. Explained in: docs/flows/Ban_Quarantine_Flow.md
flowchart TD
    TRIG[Detection or analyst action] --> CHOICE{severity}
    CHOICE -->|reversible| FREEZE[freeze: authorize denied]
    CHOICE -->|isolate| QUAR[quarantine: auth refused 401]
    CHOICE -->|credential kill| REV[revoke: token invalid]
    CHOICE -->|durable| BAN[ban record: gates future runs*]
    FREEZE & QUAR & REV & BAN --> EV[audit event + SOC event]
    EV --> AUTHC[get_agent_by_token excludes<br/>quarantined + deleted → fail closed]
